    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25449" root="ضبأ" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضْبَأٌ</span></b>  <i>A place where one conceals himself,</i> (S,
TA,) <i>in a covert of trees,</i> or <i>in a hollow in the
ground, to deceive,</i> or <i>circumvent, the game,</i> or
<i>prey:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَابِئُ</span>. (TA.)

